{"type":"assistant","uuid":"f4fcae652e3c4d2c9ab15de65f8b821f","session_id":"27f3764f-c0df-4208-97c8-9d1a11200fc7","message":{"id":"f4fcae652e3c4d2c9ab15de65f8b821f","content":[{"type":"text","text":"已完成标签管理功能的代码实现。\n\n**实现内容：**\n\n1. **后端标签 CRUD 功能**\n   - `loadTags()` - 加载所有标签\n   - `saveNewTag()` / `saveUpdatedTag()` / `deleteTagById()` - 标签的创建、更新、删除\n   - `assignTagsToTask()` / `removeTagsFromTask()` - 任务标签绑定/解绑\n   - `loadTagIdsForTask()` / `loadTagsForTask()` - 加载任务关联的标签\n\n2. **标签筛选功能**\n   - `normalizeFilterParameters()` 支持 `tag_id` 筛选参数\n   - `filterTasks()` 支持按标签筛选任务\n\n3. **输入验证**\n   - `validateTagInput()` - 校验标签名称（空名称、超长名称、重复名称拦截）\n   - `validateTagInput()` 支持排除指定 ID 避免编辑时与自身重名冲突\n\n4. **调试日志**\n   - 关键操作均有 `writeDebugLog` 输出（标签创建、绑定、筛选、删除等）\n\n5. **前端 UI**\n   - 任务表单中添加标签多选器（checkbox 形式）\n   - 任务列表卡片中展示标签 badge\n   - 筛选表单中添加按标签筛选下拉框\n   - 独立的标签管理面板（创建、编辑、删除）\n\n已完成"}],"model":"minimax-m2.7","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":112171,"output_tokens":630,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"__timestamp":"2026-05-31T18:17:23.068Z","_requestId":"877e12d40e8845d791c7472c08ca184d"}

